{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12204290","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12204290","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1220429001:0":{"text":"何人かは守衛に扮してここに残り、まだ人質がいるフリをしろ。","source_cn":"你留几个人假扮成守卫，伪装成人质还在这里的样子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB87550DD67D85724","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220429002:0":{"text":"はい、若頭！","source_cn":"好的，二当家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29AAD7AEB795D3E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220429003:0":{"text":"口封じはしっかりやれよ。少しの情報も胴元に漏らすな、いいな？","source_cn":"都把嘴封严了，不准有一点消息传到庄家那里，明白吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B7324F708EB53AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220429004:0":{"text":"分かりました！","source_cn":"明白，二当家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA70F369BC51F6AA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220429005:0":{"text":"ルカさん、部下がやられたことを知れば胴元がたじろぐかもしれないだろ？なんで隠すんだ？","source_cn":"卢卡先生，庄家知道被打疼了才会心有忌惮，为什么要隐藏消息？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC869542998B17F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220429006:0":{"text":"よく聞け、ある事態を根本から解決するには、大量の資金と綿密な計画、そして絶対的な力の三つのうち、少なくとも二つが必要なんだ。","source_cn":"听好了，想要彻底解决一件事，大量的钱、精密的计划和绝对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29EE987A0F2D425D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220429007:0":{"text":"これもボスから教わった。かつての俺は力にばかり頼って苦労した。だからこのことを肝に銘じるようになったんだ。","source_cn":"这是索尼娅教会我的。我过去只懂得依靠力量，吃了大亏，所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF306D0A930D4FECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220429008:0":{"text":"ラスティーアンカーだろうとほかの場所だろうと、苦境から抜け出せたいなら、力だけではなく頭も使うんだ。","source_cn":"小子，记住，无论是在锈锚港还是别的地方，只靠蛮力不动脑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E29C879D4A9181F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220429009:0":{"text":"情報を隠す理由は、自分でよく考えてみるんだな。","source_cn":"至于为什么要隐藏消息，你自己好好想想吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC121385DD4E741F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220429010:0":{"text":"……わ、分かったよ、ルカさん。","source_cn":"……我、我知道了，卢卡先生。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25917A9BEC2FCD63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢卡":{"te